UnitDynamicSwapFeeHook::BulkUpdateFees
├── when caller is not Fee Manager
│   └── it should revert with "NFM"
└── when caller is Fee Manager
    ├── when pools array and fees array are not the same length
    │   └── it should revert with "LMM"
    └── when pools array and fees array are the same length
        ├── when one of the fee is bigger than max fee
        │   └── it should revert with "MBF"
        └── when all the fees are smaller than max fee
            ├── when the pool is invalid
            │   └── it should revert with "PNP"
            └── when the pool is valid
                ├── it should update the fee for all pool
                └── it should emit a {CustomFeeSet} event for all pools
